From cdcc4fe0f786b3e063e6ddc154c3c5cf923b5829 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kavin Arasu <21kla5@queensu.ca>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:25:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Resolve Level 2 climbing and stamina bar PR onto current
 master

Rebase of PR #12 (lvl2working) onto 3993066. The PR was based on
2650cb9, before the AssetManager, EventManager, GameObject system,
player health/movement, sprite scaling and audio PRs landed, so a
plain merge conflicts in level.cpp, level_2.cpp, player.cpp and
player.h and would revert those systems.

Climbing and stamina are integrated into the current player
movement instead: holding W/UP beside a platform latches on and
climbs at climbSpeed, horizontal movement is disabled while
climbing, jumping needs stamina, and stamina regenerates on the
ground, drains while climbing, and drains while airborne. The
stamina bar is drawn above the player in Level::Draw, which now
takes the GameConfig; both call sites in main.cpp pass it. Level 2
is rebuilt as objects (5 climbable pillars, 20 ledges, floor) with
the PR's taller world, instead of the old stair layout.

Adds a self-test for climbing, stamina drain, ground regen and
reset.
